&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(13, 111, 91);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking to add a&lt;strong&gt; high-potential Sales Associate&lt;/strong&gt; to our &lt;strong&gt;Investor Sales team&lt;/strong&gt; to help drive new business growth within the investment community.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will own the full sales cycle—from sourcing and qualifying new leads to leading product demonstrations, coordinating with research teams, and closing new business.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a &lt;strong&gt;new business–focused (hunting) role&lt;/strong&gt; with uncapped earning potential. &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note that this is a 100% hunting role!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
