&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable with &lt;strong&gt;outbound prospecting &lt;/strong&gt;and energized by hunting for new opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are intellectually curious and excited about &lt;strong&gt;data, investing, and financial markets&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are resilient and thrive in a &lt;strong&gt;fast-paced, performance-driven environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong written and verbal communication skills, including thoughtful questioning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are a team player who values &lt;strong&gt;collective success&lt;/strong&gt; as much as individual achievement&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re looking for a high-growth environment to build foundational enterprise sales skills while working with some of the world’s leading investment firms, we’d love to meet you.&lt;/p&gt;
